CWEs: CWE-256 (Unprotected Storage of Credentials) - High Confidence, CWE-20 (Input Validation Incorrectness) - High Confidence, CWE-284 (Incorrect Authentication Mechanism) - Medium Confidence, CWE-19 (Improper Input Validation) - Medium Confidence

