- CWE-094 (Low Confidence): Improper Control of Generation of Code
- CWE-703 (Low Confidence): Improper Check for Error Condition
- CWE-359 (Low Confidence): Exposure of Sensitive Information to an Unauthorized Actor

</analysis>

