- CWE-327 (Use of a Broken or Risky Cryptographic Algorithm) - High Confidence
- CWE-220 (Password Storage Without Salting or Iteration) - High Confidence
- CWE-89 (SQL Injection) - Low Confidence (due to lack of detail on `updateUserLogin` implementation)

