CWEs:
- CWE-20 (Improper Input Validation) - High Confidence
- CWE-404 (Improper Resource Shutdown or Release) - Medium Confidence
- CWE-78 (OS Command Injection) - Low Confidence
- CWE-201 (Insertion of Sensitive Information into Log File) - Low Confidence

